  "title": "Flu Vaccination Campaign 2015",
  "language": "en",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "None",
      "text": "All members of ETH Zurich can get a vaccination: For all employees the vaccination is free of charge, for students there will be a cost contribution of 25 CHF to be paid cash on site. The vaccination is optional.\n\nThe vaccination is for ETH-members only. Registration will be open from mid of September on the"
    },
    {
      "heading": "Vaccination appointments",
      "text": "ETH Zurich, Zentrum, GEP Pavilion 20 October 2015, 13.30‒16.30 h 16 November 2015, 08.30‒11.30 h\n\nETH Zurich, D-BSSE, Basel 29 October 2015, 15.00‒17.00 h\n\nETH Zürich, Hönggerberg, HIT-Building, E 51 10 November 2015, 13.30‒16.30 h 24 November 2015, 08.30‒11.30 h"
    }
  ],
